# Ensign Harry Kim: "Whenever another creature you control enters, if it has greater power than Ensign Kim, put a
# +1/+1 counter on Ensign Kim" (CR 603.4) and "{2}, Remove two +1/+1 counters from among creatures you control: Draw a
# card" (CR 118.3). Elite Vanguard (2/1) and Serra Angel (4/4) both have greater power than Kim as he is when each
# enters, so he collects two counters; paying them with {2} on turn 13 shrinks him back to 1/2.

